                    Information/Legal, Box 25, Latin America, 2/68–12/78. Confidential. Pastor forwarded the memorandum and attachment
                    under a July 20 covering memorandum to Thornton, Tuchman,
                        Denend, Hormats, and Huberman. (Ibid.)</p>
            </note>
